('Los chamanes hablan con la Madre Espora. Ella les contesta con esporas, y ellos las reparten.','The shamans speak with the Spore Mother. She answers them with spores, and they spread them.','Os xamãs falam com a Mãe Esporo. Ela responde com esporos, e eles os espalham.'),
